	4. Locked decisions
* Media station colour amber #F2B66D. Ice retired for media.
* Loader 8 seconds, four status lines, "Take off" button; reduced motion 1.2 s. 5.2 s version retired.
* Voice widget always on top. Panels never cover the sphere centre.
* No purple. Teal only for the voice orb (ramp v100–v700). Red #FF5666 only for errors and Blocked.
* Glass never solid: solid surface token removed; readable surfaces use glass-lite 0.92 over a dim backing. Max blur 12 px, max two blurred surfaces.
* Gate code 4 digits (3x4 keypad). Phone sheet snaps 50% / 92%. Tour hold 4000 ms. Lite tier below 720 px.
* Insight yellow #FFD54A allowed as a flat panel colour. Budget = arc gauge; segmented bar on phone.
* Sample names only in the design system. No Three.js script tag copied into the app.
* Builder routing: Cursor builds, Claude Code reviews only, Claude Design designs. No Cursor upgrades until the design system was ready (now ready).
* Build order: connectivity, motion and wiring first; visual polish last.
* Voice behaviour: execute without narrating; silence is never a yes; "saved/sent" only after confirmation; masculine Arabic self-reference; Egyptian Arabic structure with English tech terms; "sir" sparingly.
